<p>Locally you should see <code>hi</code>, a newline, then <code>err</code>=
 (both streams end up in the printed blob).</p>
<h3 id=3D"start-and-wait">Start and Wait</h3>
<p><code>Start()</code> launches the child without waiting; <code>Wait()</c=
ode> blocks until the process exits and I/O copying finishes. Use this when=
