<p>You should see <code>started</code>, then about one second later <code>d=
one</code>.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"capture-stdout-and-stderr">Capture stdout and stderr</h2>
<p>External commands can write to two different streams:</p>

<div class=3D"article-table-wrap" data-article-table=3D"">
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Stream</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>stdout</td>
