<h2 id=3D"add-timeout-or-cancellation">Add timeout or cancellation</h2>
<h3 id=3D"commandcontext">CommandContext</h3>
<p><code>exec.CommandContext</code> ties the child=E2=80=99s lifetime to a =
<a href=3D"https://pkg.go.dev/context" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener no=
referrer"><code>context.Context</code></a>. When the context is canceled or=
 its deadline passes, the process is stopped. Pairing <code>defer cancel()<=
/code> with <code>context.WithTimeout</code> matches the pattern described =
in <a href=3D"https://www.golinuxcloud.com/golang-defer-keyword/">defer key=
word in Go</a>.</p>
<div class=3D"code-block">
<div class=3D"code-header">
<span class=3D"code-lang">go</span><span class=3D"code-actions"><button typ=
e=3D"button" class=3D"code-copy" data-code-copy=3D"">Copy</button></span></=
div><div class=3D"highlight"><pre tabindex=3D"0" class=3D"chroma"><code cla=
ss=3D"language-go" data-lang=3D"go"><span class=3D"line"><span class=3D"cl"=
