<h3 id=3D"kill-long-running-commands-and-avoid-hanging-forever">Kill long-r=
unning commands and avoid hanging forever</h3>
<p>Without a context deadline, a blocked child can block your goroutine ind=
efinitely. Prefer <code>CommandContext</code> for network-facing or user-tr=
iggered commands, and always drain or close pipes when you use streaming I/=
O to avoid deadlocks (see the Common mistakes section below).</p>
